SUMMARY:Galaxy Cluster France Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Galaxy clusters are powerful cosmological probes\, tracing the matter content and large-scale structure of the Universe. Observed across the electromagnetic spectrum\, they are dominated by dark matter with baryons in hot gas and galaxies. Recent and forthcoming surveys (Planck\, eROSITA\, Euclid\, LSST) are delivering large cluster samples\, enabling precision cosmology and enable new insights into the\nhttps://indico.obspm.fr/event/3124/
